
Digital Presence Audit: Top7 Orlando

• Target Domain: top7orlandoapartment.com
• Physical Location: 7 Massenya Street, Wuse Zone 6, Abuja (FCT)
• Primary Offerings: Luxury Hotel Rooms, Apartments, Restaurant, Bar, and Live Band Entertainment
• Price Points: ₦100,000 to ₦170,000 / night (excluding 7.5% VAT)
• Overall Digital Footprint Score: 2.5 out of 5 stars (Under-Optimized & Risk-Exposed)

1. Google Business Profile (GBP) & Map Audit

• GBP Listing Status: Critical Disconnect / Non-Existent.
• The Search Failure: A broad search for "Top7 Orlando Abuja" or "Top7 Orlando Apartment" fails to trigger a verified, dedicated Google Knowledge Panel or active map listing. Instead, the algorithm routes users to local Wuse Zone 6 competitors or general apartment aggregates in Abuja.
• Review Volume: 0 Google Reviews. Because there is no active, optimized GBP tied to their exact Massenya Street location, they have zero indexable social proof or guest sentiment data on Google Maps.

2. Website & Technical SEO Audit

• The Security Flaw (Critical Audit Finding): The website's booking backend has a severe data exposure vulnerability. The website publicly prints and exposes internal guest booking history logs directly in the frontend room selection source code (revealing precise check-in/check-out timestamps ranging across past dates up to recent bookings). This is a massive privacy risk for a luxury hotel in Abuja.
• SEO & Metadata Architecture: Poor. The title tag and layout headers are basic portfolio structures rather than optimized target terms. They completely miss out on local high-intent keyword optimization such as "Boutique hotels in Wuse Zone 6" or "Luxury hotel with 24/7 power in Abuja".
• User Experience (UX): The website features an interactive room reservation drawer that breaks down base prices and applies the 7.5% Nigerian VAT directly (e.g., ₦100,000 room becomes ₦107,500 grand total). However, the contact forms route to generic email addresses (kcbillion@gmail.com) rather than a secure, automated property management system.

3. Local SEO & Brand Visibility

• High-Intent Location Advantage: Wuse Zone 6 is a highly coveted commercial and hospitality hub in Abuja. Being located right on Massenya Street means they have premium physical positioning, but their digital footprint does not mirror this prominence.
• Feature Execution: They possess strong marketable assets—including a dedicated restaurant, a standard cocktail bar, guaranteed 24/7 electricity, and a popular Live Band night every Thursday. None of these premium features are indexed or searchable on search engine map packs due to the missing GBP asset.

Strategic Recommendations for the Report

1. Immediate Database Scrubbing (Urgent): The web developer must immediately rewrite the booking system scripts to block internal database transaction arrays (the raw check-in/out stamps) from exposing themselves on the public-facing HTML page.
2. Launch a Geo-Targeted GBP: Deploy a highly targeted Google Business Profile named "Top7 Orlando Hotel & Apartment Wuse" to lock down the Massenya Street map coordinate.
3. Transition to Corporate Channels: Replace raw personal Gmail addresses (kcbillion@gmail.com) within the site footers with the professional domain alias (reservations@top7orlandoapartment.com) to instantly uplift brand authority.